I found another fun way to steal from shops:  a wand of teleportation will
send all the things from a shop (top layer if it's piles) in a certain range
on a line to other parts of the dungeon.  Also, you don't have to pay to use
wands, so if you find a wand of teleportation, you can teleport everything
out of the shop..  I don't know if you can take some back for cash, tho.
